OL,3,GNEWSAShrine to Doctor Who spin-off
OL,4,Acharacter to be regenerated into piece
OL,5,Aof art
OL,6,
OL,7,FA shrine for a much-loved character
OL,8,Ffrom Doctor Who spin-off show Torchwood
OL,9,Fhas been given a new lease on life as a
OL,10,Fpermanent artwork just months after
OL,11,Fbeing removed.
OL,13,FFans who built the tribute to Ianto
OL,14,FJones in Cardiff 17 years ago were
OL,15,F"devastated" in March when it was
OL,16,Fannounced it would be taken down on
OL,17,Fhealth and safety grounds.
OL,19,FNow Cardiff-based artist Nathan Wyburn
OL,20,Fis turning all of the fan tributes into
OL,21,Fa giant portrait of the actor who
OL,22,Fplayed Ianto, Gareth David-Lloyd.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
